[SPEAKER_00]: They wouldn't have me there.

44:08.130 --> 44:13.414
[SPEAKER_01]: When you come in, ask for the still.

44:15.895 --> 44:17.016
[SPEAKER_01]: And then you can hang out in there.

44:18.017 --> 44:23.420
[SPEAKER_01]: And then Ferd will know that he needs to send a runner.

44:23.761 --> 44:24.341
[SPEAKER_01]: If we're not there.

44:24.361 --> 44:25.882
[SPEAKER_00]: So you'll talk to the bartender?

44:26.422 --> 44:26.963
[SPEAKER_00]: This Ferd?

44:27.703 --> 44:28.284
[SPEAKER_00]: Of course, yeah.

44:28.944 --> 44:29.164
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

44:29.905 --> 44:30.265
[SPEAKER_01]: All right.

44:32.627 --> 44:34.308
[SPEAKER_01]: We'll let you shake your hand if that means nothing.

44:36.165 --> 44:39.026
[SPEAKER_01]: Guards?

44:39.046 --> 44:41.026
[SPEAKER_01]: Do you doubt that we have the coinage?

44:41.166 --> 44:44.147
[SPEAKER_00]: No, I doubt you have the coinage.

44:46.147 --> 44:48.468
[SPEAKER_01]: Just making sure.

44:49.188 --> 44:50.589
[SPEAKER_01]: Is there anything that you're concerned about?

44:52.169 --> 44:52.789
[SPEAKER_00]: The beating.

44:55.630 --> 44:57.170
[SPEAKER_00]: We'll tell them to go for bruises.

44:59.111 --> 45:00.511
[SPEAKER_02]: That's so broken bones.

45:00.831 --> 45:01.551
[SPEAKER_01]: No broken bones.

45:03.012 --> 45:04.092
[SPEAKER_02]: I appreciate that.

45:05.859 --> 45:07.080
[SPEAKER_02]: Don't take it personal, like I said.

45:07.500 --> 45:08.981
[SPEAKER_02]: I wouldn't be surprised if you got broken enough.

45:09.041 --> 45:17.988
[SPEAKER_01]: I'll bring a healing drop for you in three days if it happens to be anything more serious than just some bruises.

45:18.328 --> 45:20.089
[SPEAKER_01]: But, are you cleared?

45:20.109 --> 45:21.150
[SPEAKER_01]: Do you have any questions about us?

45:21.851 --> 45:22.111
[SPEAKER_00]: None.

45:22.651 --> 45:22.891
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

45:23.632 --> 45:30.697
[SPEAKER_01]: And should Ferd's place end up being burned to the ground for some reason?

45:31.998 --> 45:33.019
[SPEAKER_01]: We, of course, you know...

45:38.032 --> 45:41.714
[SPEAKER_01]: I have a photographic memory, so... Yeah, alright.

45:43.315 --> 45:45.276
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, so the two of you walk out.

45:45.756 --> 45:48.598
[SPEAKER_01]: You totally got no pokers.

45:50.059 --> 45:51.199
[SPEAKER_02]: Give them the basic beating.

45:51.439 --> 45:54.601
[SPEAKER_01]: Basic beating, no broken bones, throw them in the body pile.

45:54.701 --> 45:55.422
[SPEAKER_01]: No gouged eyes.

45:56.262 --> 45:56.722
[SPEAKER_01]: Guards!

45:57.403 --> 45:58.363
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

45:58.723 --> 46:00.785
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, so where do you guys want to go now?

46:01.645 --> 46:02.826
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, what do you got for your next thing?

46:05.319 --> 46:09.129
[SPEAKER_02]: Again, we can just wander the foreign district with the Immoculate.

46:09.229 --> 46:10.372
[SPEAKER_01]: Oh, I also grabbed the Immoculate.

46:10.392 --> 46:16.527
[SPEAKER_01]: Why don't we go put under surveillance the boots where you got that and maybe don't wear that?

46:17.289 --> 46:19.133
