46:19.153 --> 46:19.955
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, so wait a second.

46:19.975 --> 46:21.058
[SPEAKER_00]: That's what I'm gonna say.

46:21.459 --> 46:22.502
[SPEAKER_00]: You guys walk upstairs.

